@catalog = https://localhost:7232

### Liveness — is the process responsive?
GET {{catalog}}/alive

### Readiness — responsive AND can reach SQL Server
GET {{catalog}}/health

### OpenAPI document
GET {{catalog}}/openapi/v1.json

### List products (paged)
GET {{catalog}}/products?page=1&pageSize=20

### List products filtered by category
GET {{catalog}}/products?category=Furniture

### Create a product
# @name createProduct
POST {{catalog}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "USB-C Dock",
  "description": "11-port dock with 100W power passthrough.",
  "price": 189.95,
  "category": "Peripherals"
}

### Get the product just created
GET {{catalog}}/products/{{createProduct.response.body.id}}

### Update it
PUT {{catalog}}/products/{{createProduct.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "USB-C Dock Pro",
  "description": "13-port dock with 140W power passthrough.",
  "price": 229.00,
  "category": "Peripherals"
}

### Delete it
DELETE {{catalog}}/products/{{createProduct.response.body.id}}

### Validation failure — expect 400 with an RFC 7807 problem document
POST {{catalog}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "",
  "price": -5,
  "category": ""
}

### Price with too many decimal places — expect 400
POST {{catalog}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mouse Pad",
  "description": "Cloth surface, stitched edge.",
  "price": 12.999,
  "category": "Peripherals"
}

### Unknown id — expect 404
GET {{catalog}}/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
